    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but even the help feels like it’s for a person i used to be. i don't even recognize myself anymore. it’s not even scary at this point, just... inevitable. like, why keep the lights on in a house that's already empty? it just feels exhausting to struggle against something that's clearly already happening.",
